MFLOW 2
NAME Rain, fire & heaters
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Rain01 rains on the left bucket; IRHeater01\nboils the drops below it off as steam.\nFluff drops on Fire01 and keeps it burning;\nstart Rain02 to put the fire out. Heater01\nboils the water in its pipe to steam.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Rain02: Rain - the fire goes out (OUT).\nFire01: Ignite again; shut Shutter01 to stop\nthe fluff. IRHeater01 / Heater01: Auto start.\nSlide01 shuts the water line.

